seg-072bdea11014 = Version <c1/> over <c2/> (parameters pre-registered in the base method, unchanged). MODELLED: there is no external oracle, no ground truth and no cause attribution. A degraded cell means a high share of the aircraft sampled there reported low navigation accuracy that day; it does not say why. A cell that is not observed, or absent, was not assessed, which is not the same as clear.

