seg-9fa2d2319ed3 = <b>Region and days:</b> the box { "53.5" }, { "9.0" }, { "66.0" }, { "31.0" } (south, west, north, east: the Baltic Sea and its coasts), { "30" } UTC days from 2026-09-15 to 2026-10-14, { "0.5" } degree cells, by <c1/> (one day at a time, raw files deleted after each day).

