seg-81cfcbf0de89 = The calls are sensitive to the accuracy-code thresholds and the sampling rules, and the small counts move a lot.

# text
# c1: low_nic_max
# c2: degraded_share
# c3: min_reports_per_aircraft_in_cell
# c4: low_nic_max
